+# ColossusX modifications to wagmi
+
+Modified on 2026-09-21 by the ColossusX project.
+
+This directory vendors npm release `wagmi@2.19.5`, distributed by its authors
+under the MIT license retained in `LICENSE`. Upstream TypeScript source and
+compiled package files are included.
+
+Upstream archive: https://registry.npmjs.org/wagmi/-/wagmi-2.19.5.tgz
+
+Verified upstream archive SHA-512 (base64):
+`RQUfKMv6U+EcSNNGiPbdkDtJwtuFxZWLmvDiQmjjBgkuPulUwDJsKhi7gjynzJdsx2yDqhHCXkKsbbfbIsHfcQ==`
+
+Changes: removed the `@wagmi/connectors` dependency, the `wagmi/connectors`
+package export and type mapping, the connector entry directory, and its
+TypeScript/compiled export files. React hooks and `@wagmi/core` are retained.
+No third-party wallet connector implementations are included in this copy.
+
+This avoids installing separately restricted wallet SDKs through optional
+connectors. ColossusX disables wallet connection and signing. Future wallet
+integrations require their own dependency review.
+
+The package version remains upstream's version for compatibility; this modified
+copy is explicitly selected using `file:./vendor/wagmi`.
